{
  "version": 1,
  "comments": {
    "c2": {
      "anchor": "p-openapi-ingest#field-4",
      "kind": "field",
      "label": "OpenAPI Ingest",
      "excerpt": "A made-up API to test against. An OpenAPI 3.1 description in FastAPI's shape, @a",
      "text": "This should be saved in the JSON5 and api.spell",
      "by": "owenoak",
      "at": "2026-11-17T20:24:02.558Z",
      "status": "answered",
      "quote": "No real data in checked-in files",
      "offset": 1498,
      "edited": "2026-11-17T20:24:08.280Z",
      "replies": [
        {
          "by": "owenoak",
          "agent": "claude",
          "at": "2026-11-17T20:29:35.530Z",
          "html": "<p>Keeping real values out is now a setting of the place:  written in its <code>.api.json5</code> and said in its <code>.api.spell</code>, so every later ingest, update and check keeps to it, and the flags only set it (plan step 5, a note on <a href=\"#j249\">J249</a>).  The rows go under <code>~/.spell/</code> in <code>read-page</code>'s samples files (<a href=\"#j259\">J259</a>).  Its Spell words are new, so they wait on your pick:  <a href=\"#q55\">Q55</a>.</p>"
        }
      ],
      "done": {
        "how": "good",
        "at": "2026-11-17T20:45:15.491Z",
        "by": "owenoak"
      },
      "claim": {
        "by": "owenoak",
        "agent": "claude",
        "at": "2026-11-17T20:26:34.970Z"
      }
    },
    "c3": {
      "anchor": "q56",
      "kind": "item",
      "label": "Do the verify states, unverified, verified, failed and untyped, end a live at line, reopening Q45?",
      "excerpt": "Do the verify states, unverified, verified, failed and untyped, end a live at line, reopening Q45?",
      "text": "`[this] type is? verified, failed` or \"OK\" at the thing level.  OK by default.",
      "by": "owenoak",
      "at": "2026-11-17T21:09:57.841Z",
      "status": "answered",
      "replies": [
        {
          "by": "owenoak",
          "agent": "claude",
          "at": "2026-11-17T21:14:03.529Z",
          "html": "<p>Recorded on <a href=\"#q56\">Q56</a> as your option C, and chosen:  the states go on the thing, not on the <code>live at</code> line.  That reopens <a href=\"#q45\">Q45</a> for the thing level, noted there.</p>\n<p>The forms P49 builds:  <code>this type is verified</code> or <code>this type is failed</code>, with <code>this</code> and <code>is</code> optional (<code>type verified</code>);  Spanish <code>este tipo está verificado</code>, <code>este tipo falló</code>.  No line is OK.</p>\n<p>One thing your words leave open:  whether an untried type says <code>this type is unverified</code>, or shows nothing like a verified one.  That's <a href=\"#q62\">Q62</a>.</p>"
        }
      ],
      "claim": {
        "by": "owenoak",
        "agent": "claude",
        "at": "2026-11-17T21:11:58.623Z"
      }
    },
    "c4": {
      "anchor": "q58",
      "kind": "item",
      "label": "How is a thing's whole route turned off, or made read only, now that writes are enabled operations?",
      "excerpt": "How is a thing's whole route turned off, or made read only, now that writes are enabled operations?",
      "text": "`all operations are disabled` in the thing",
      "by": "owenoak",
      "at": "2026-11-17T21:10:31.545Z",
      "status": "answered",
      "replies": [
        {
          "by": "owenoak",
          "agent": "claude",
          "at": "2026-11-17T21:14:04.693Z",
          "html": "<p>Recorded on <a href=\"#q58\">Q58</a> as your option D, and chosen:  <code>all operations are disabled</code> on the thing turns the whole route off, reading too.  Spanish:  <code>todas las operaciones están desactivadas</code>.</p>\n<p>Beside the other forms:</p>\n<ul>\n<li><code>enabled operations are all</code> is the default, said out loud.  <code>all operations are enabled</code> reads the same, so both are built.</li>\n<li><code>enabled operations are add, change</code> narrows the writes.</li>\n<li>A read only thing is still open:  <a href=\"#q61\">Q61</a>, <code>enabled operations are read</code> or <code>... are none</code>.</li>\n</ul>"
        }
      ],
      "claim": {
        "by": "owenoak",
        "agent": "claude",
        "at": "2026-11-17T21:11:59.769Z"
      }
    }
  },
  "on": {}
}
